[00:31.00]she puts on her make up 她为自己化上了妆
[00:36.00]and brushes her long blond hair 梳着自己长长的金发
[00:42.00]and then she ask me: "Do I look all right?" 之后她问我：“我好看吗？”
[00:50.00]and I say: "yes' you look wonderful tonight" 我说：“嗯，你今晚真美”
[01:06.00]
