[01:52.60]lighting in your eyes 在你的眼里发亮
[01:56.60]and the wonder of it all 世所罕有
[02:00.60]is that you just don't realize 只是你还没有察觉到
[02:04.60]how much I love you... 我爱你有多深
[02:27.60]
